 +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta  & =1 \\\\ {cos}^{2}⁡\\theta  & =1-{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\ 2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta  & =2-2{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $sin⁡\\theta =\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{4}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta  & =2-2{(\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{4})}^{2} \\\\  & =2-2(\\frac{10}{16}) \\\\  & =2-\\frac{20}{16} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo our final answer is $2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{3}{4}.$" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244782 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244783 13194139533658 true] [17592186244782 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244784 13194139533658 true] [17592186244782 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244785 13194139533658 true] [17592186244782 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244786 13194139533658 true] [17592186244782 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244787 13194139533658 true] [17592186244782 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533658 true] [17592186244782 1041 "selection" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244782 1104 #edb/ref 17592186244785 13194139533658 true] [17592186244782 1110 #uuid "2769842c-de42-5444-b0a8-f64b39b160b4" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244783 1034 "\\frac{6}{5}" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244783 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533658 true] [17592186244783 1111 #uuid "9e27fa36-a5ef-5848-98c0-7f72b264ed62" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244784 1034 "\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244784 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533658 true] [17592186244784 1111 #uuid "fe4d1e0d-f58c-589a-8e51-2249af6c384e" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244785 1034 "\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244785 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533658 true] [17592186244785 1111 #uuid "9fee02c0-effd-5e07-bbd4-c037e2ba2b18" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244786 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244786 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533658 true] [17592186244786 1111 #uuid "ce77f37d-58fa-57ab-b1ad-32be6f8bac8c" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244787 1034 "\\frac{3}{8}" 13194139533658 true] [17592186244787 1103 #edb/ref 1759218604